==Russian==

===Etymology===
{{ety|ru|:bor|cu:власть|tree=+}}
{{bor+|ru|cu|власть}}, from {{der|ru|sla-pro|*volstь}}. {{doublet|ru|во́лость}}, the inherited East Slavic form. {{surf|ru|владеть|alt1=влад(е́ть)|*-tь|lang2=sla-pro}}.

